DESCRIPTION:Finals are coming\, so take a study break that still counts as
  studying! Join Psychology Club for Psychology Bingo Night. Every bingo c
 ard is filled with psychology concepts and topics\, from classical condit
 ioning to cognitive dissonance. Mark them off as we call them out and see
  how much you remember.\nIt’s a low-key way to relax\, hang out with othe
 r psych students\, and brush up on what you know before finals week. And 
 yes\, there will be prizes!\n\nHosted by: Psychology Club at Indiana Univ
 ersity\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indi
