DESCRIPTION:“Keep Calm and Chipotle On: Study Night” is a pre-finals gathe
 ring where residents can enjoy a Chipotle meal\, study alongside neighbor
 s\, and take a well-deserved break from the stress of upcoming exams. The
  event creates a welcoming\, supportive space for residents to focus\, re
 charge\, and connect with others in the community. By bringing residents 
 together before finals\, the program offers a chance to share encourageme
 nt\, build connections\, and feel more prepared for the busy week ahead.\
 n\nHosted by: \n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvol
 ved.indiana.edu/event/12994142
