BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:IU beINvolved Student Orgs
CATEGORIES:ThoughtfulLearning
CATEGORIES:Leadership & Engagement
DESCRIPTION:Join fellow fraternity and sorority leaders for the 2027 Greek
  Leadership Academy (GLA)\, an immersive overnight leadership experience 
 at Bradford Woods focused on helping participants lead with confidence\, 
 competence\, and purpose. Through engaging workshops\, team-building expe
 riences\, meaningful conversations\, and cross-council collaboration\, at
 tendees will explore how to lead themselves\, inspire others\, navigate c
 hallenges\, and strengthen the fraternity and sorority community. Grounde
 d in the pillars of Lead Self\, Lead Others\, Lead Culture\, and Lead Com
 munity\, GLA is designed to help participants develop practical leadershi
 p skills they can immediately apply within their chapters\, councils\, an
 d future careers. \n\nOvernight Retreat Information\nAs this is an overni
 ght retreat at Bradford Woods\, participants should plan to bring:\n\nTwi
 n-size sheets (or a sleeping bag)\nBlanket\nPillow\nToiletries\nTowel\nAn
 y personal items needed for an overnight stay\n\n \nTransportation to and
  from Bradford Woods will be provided\, so attendees do not need to arran
 ge their own transportation.\n \nWhat to Wear\nThe majority of retreat pr
 ogramming will take place indoors. However\, participants should be prepa
 red for brief walks between cabins and program facilities\, as well as th
 e optional evening campfire social. We recommend bringing comfortable clo
 thing\, closed-toe shoes\, and layers appropriate for the forecast.\nBefo
 re traveling to Bradford Woods\, please review The Weather Channel. \nWe 
 look forward to a weekend of learning\, connection\, leadership developme
 nt\, and strengthening our fraternity and sorority community together\n\n
  \n \n\nHosted by: Sorority and Fraternity Life\n\nAdditional Information
  can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/13000191
DTEND:20270123T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20261128T072916Z
DTSTART:20270122T210000Z
